[l_english.STATE_LORE_336]
When the wings of the Wonderbolts were broken in the Cloudsdale crackdown, these rebels learned the most dangerous survival tactic — how to resist authority with silence. The first regional commissioner sent by the Royal Commission waited in vain at the Stratusburg city hall for three days, only to find even the corner coffee stall refused to serve him. Not out of hatred, but because they “happened to overlook the gentleman’s presence”. Before the ink on the Canterlot Accord had even dried, Spitfire and her retired pegasi had invented an entirely new political maneuver. After years of strategic games, they completely reshaped the political landscape of Cloudsdale and other regions. Now the Empire is forced to allocate annual subsidies to this tiny autonomous zone, ostensibly to support local residents’... uh... independence movements.
But there’s always a leash attached to imperial benefits. Under the watchful eyes and surveillance posts of the Empire, the Washouts, the Chamber of Commerce, and the Meteorological Bureau, Stratusburg has had to adopt a rat-like survival strategy: when noticed, retreat into your hole and never peek out; when their gaze shifts, dart out to take a bite — lest you starve. Fortunately, the residents of Stratusburg have grown quite accustomed to this lifestyle. Unfortunately, when presented with a mousetrap from Timbucktu laden with cheese, few ponies can resist the temptation.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_336]
当闪电天马队的翅膀折断在云中城的镇压中时，这群叛逆者学会了最危险的生存之道 —— 如何用沉默对抗强权。皇家委员会派来的第一任地区委员在层云堡市政厅空等了三天，最终发现连街角的咖啡摊都拒绝为他服务。不是因为仇恨，而是“恰好没注意到这位先生的存在”。《坎特洛特协定》的墨迹未干，喷火就带着她的退役天马们发明了全新的政治戏法。经过数年的博弈，云中城等地区的政治格局已经被她们彻底改变，而现在帝国每年都不得不为这个小小的自治区拨发补贴，用以补贴当地居民的... 额... 独立运动。
但从帝国获取收益永远有一条绳子束缚，在帝国、淘汰者、商业委员会与气象局的监视哨下，层云堡不得不接受像老鼠一样的生存法则：每当对方注意到你的时候，就要在老鼠洞里缩好，千万不能探头；而每当对方视线一移开，就要迅速窜出来咬他一口，这样才不至于陷入饥饿。幸运的是，层云堡的居民们完全习惯了这种生活方式；不幸的是，当一个来自廷马克图的带有奶酪的捕鼠板被放置在面前时，没有几只小马能够抵挡住诱惑。
